{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜発表の放送がされてから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログをなかなか更新出来ずに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いてごめんなさい(TT)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"755やモバメでは短くでしたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝の気持ちなどご報告させて頂きました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふぁみたん！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長らくお待たせしてしまいました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっと選抜に入ることが出来ました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもいつも応援してくださる皆さんあっての私です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会では「どこにいても見つけるからね｣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「また頑張ろうね！」など沢山のポジティブな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"声をかけて頂いていました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どの言葉もその時の私にとって本当に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暖かくて有難い言葉でした、ですが毎度"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この言葉ばかりファンの方に言わせてしまうのも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルとしてお仕事している以上"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悔しいしダメダメだなとも思っていました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっと入れた17th選抜、入っただけで喜んでちゃダメ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここからが自分との勝負"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人数が増えたからだよとか誰にも言われないように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何で入ったの？って言われちゃわないように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなの跳ね返してやるくらいの気持ちでいるの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後ね、辛かったり悔しかったりしたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素直に言っていいんだよって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優しい言葉をかけてもらえるの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でね、嬉しかったり楽しいことは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すぐに報告してほしいなって言ってくれる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暖かい空気が私の周りには沢山溢れてるの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなに自分のことを求めてくれて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつでも1番に私のことを考えてくれて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふぁみたんが本当に愛おしい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって、イベントありますって言って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分のために遠くから駆けつけて来てくれる方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂やってなきゃ出会えてないもんね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがたいな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも皆が大切だよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな皆の素敵な顔が沢山見たいよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"空気を明るく出来る存在でもっと居たい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の居る意味はきっとそこにあるから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆の為にもっと出来ること"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂にとってもっと貢献出来ること"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと出来るはず"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰にも負けないパワーで頑張るの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それとね、七瀬が言ってくれた言葉が本当に嬉しかった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと前にね選抜に入って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次のシングルで外れてしまった時"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「何で居なくなっちゃうの、悲しい～」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言われた時、本当に申し訳なかった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ごめんね」しかその時の私は言えなくて..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何にも出来ない選抜はもう嫌だ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと任してもらえるメンバーがいいんです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次のシングルでそんな言葉を言わせちゃわないように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方にもそんな思いをさせないように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何か自分なりに掴めたらいいな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2017/02/01/6004281/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんたん ゆったんたん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"_"}],"source":"archive"}